The Head of Financial Systems will bring deep finance and operational&nbsp;expertise, real technological&nbsp;fluency&nbsp;and the ability to lead transformation in a complex, fast-scaling global enterprise. Experience in a regulated, government-contracting or aerospace and defence environment is an advantage. &nbsp;

